phases.prompt_template:
Analyze the Blue Lodge rack telemetry snapshot and produce an actionable operations triage report.

FOCUS: {{params.focus | full rack health sweep}}

FIFO PRE-FLIGHT TELEMETRY:
- System Vitals: {{phase.telemetry_snapshot.vitals}}
- Active Services: {{phase.telemetry_snapshot.services}}

STEPS:
1. Identify any resource pressure (RAM, VRAM, disk, zombie processes, unhealthy services).
2. Write structured JSON to {{result_path}} with keys: workflow, status (healthy|degraded|critical), findings (array), recommendations (array), and summary.
3. Conclude with a concise operations briefing.
